Simulates the null distribution of the generalized variance pivotal
statistic \eqn{T_1^\star} under plug-in sampling.

Under the multiple-release stacking result,
\deqn{
  \mathbf{(n-1)S}^\star_{\mathrm{M}} \mid \mathbf{S}
  \sim
  \mathcal{W}_p\left(
    Mn - 1,\;
    \mathbf{S}
  \right),
}
